{"term": {"label": "德", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "德", "variants": [], "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "經", "id": "經"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聖人", "id": "聖人"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "興", "id": "興"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "鄉原", "id": "郷原"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.3902906734131513, "source": "心", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.3902906734131513, "source": "惡", "target": "郷原"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "興", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "興", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "興", "target": "經"}, {"weight": 1.6971434928532059, "source": "亂", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 1.6971434928532059, "source": "亂", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 1.5429928130259476, "source": "亂", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.1026086009613705, "source": "亂", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.8794650496471605, "source": "亂", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.7957557815213154, "source": "亂", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 1.8306748854777286, "source": "殺", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 2.5726122302071057, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.7957557815213154, "source": "禮", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "禮", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 2.2361399935858928, "source": "禮", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 3.